  "title": "/auth/register 校验失败返回 500，应为 422",
  "branch": "agent/m56",
  "commit": "0eba773",
  "root_cause": "Pydantic v2 的 @validator 抛出 ValueError 后，exc.errors() 的 ctx 字段包含原始 ValueError 对象，JSONResponse 序列化失败导致 TypeError，被全局异常处理器捕获后返回 500",
  "fix": "在 backend/main.py 的 request_validation_exception_handler 中添加 _sanitize_errors 函数，清洗 errors 列表，只保留 loc/msg/type 三个字段",
  "files_changed": ["backend/main.py"],
  "test_files_added": ["backend/tests/test_issue27_register_422.py", "verify_issue27_fix.py"],
  "test_results": [
    {
      "test": "password_missing_special_char",
      "input": {"username": "testuser", "password": "NoSpecial123"},
      "expected_status": 422,
      "actual_status": 422,
      "sanitized_output": [{"loc": ["password"], "msg": "Value error, 密码必须包含至少一个特殊字符", "type": "value_error"}],
      "json_serializable": true,
      "status": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "test": "username_too_short",
      "input": {"username": "ab", "password": "ValidPass123!"},
